SYMBOL MUX507_2TO1 1680 336 R0
SYMATTR InstName U1
SYMBOL voltage 144 64 R0
SYMATTR InstName VDD
SYMATTR Value 5
SYMBOL voltage 368 64 R0
SYMATTR InstName VSS
SYMATTR Value 5
